#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:5
msgid "行列および行列式の公式"
msgstr "Matrix and Determinant Identities"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:11
msgid "逆行列の公式（１）"
msgstr "Inverse Matrix Formula (1)"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{I} - \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1}"
" \\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"=  \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} - \\boldsymbol{A} \\right)\n"
"= \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1} \\boldsymbol{B}"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{I} - \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1}"
" \\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"=  \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} - \\boldsymbol{A} \\right)\n"
"= \\left( \\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} \\right)^{-1} \\boldsymbol{B}"
"\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:25
msgid "ブロック行列の逆行列"
msgstr "Inverse of a Block Matrix"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{D}` と、次の式の "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{M}^{-1}=\\boldsymbol{A} - "
"\\boldsymbol{BD}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{C}` が正則であれば、 ブロック行列の逆行列は次のように書ける "
"[#mf1]_\\ 。"
msgstr ""
"If :math:`\\boldsymbol{D}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{M}^{-1}=\\boldsymbol{A} - "
"\\boldsymbol{BD}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{C}` in the second equation below are "
"invertible, the inverse of a block matrix can be written as follows "
"[#mf1]_\\ ."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{M} & -\\boldsymbol{MBD}^{-1} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{-D}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{CM} & "
"\\boldsymbol{D}^{-1}+\\boldsymbol{D}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{CMBD}^{-1} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{M} & -\\boldsymbol{MBD}^{-1} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{-D}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{CM} & "
"\\boldsymbol{D}^{-1}+\\boldsymbol{D}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{CMBD}^{-1} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{M}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A} - \\boldsymbol{BD}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{C}\n"
"\\right)^{-1}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{M}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A} - \\boldsymbol{BD}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{C}\n"
"\\right)^{-1}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:47
msgid "上記の公式を用いて、ガウス分布の共分散行列の計算で現れるケースを示しておく"
msgstr ""
"The formulas above give the following result, which arises in "
"calculations involving the covariance matrix of a Gaussian distribution."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:49
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{R}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda} + \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\boldsymbol{LA} &\n"
"-\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{L} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{-LA} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{L}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{R}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda} + \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\boldsymbol{LA} &\n"
"-\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{L} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{-LA} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{L}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{L}^{-1} + \\boldsymbol{A} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1} &\n"
"\\boldsymbol{L}^{-1} + \\boldsymbol{A} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:69
msgid "C\\. M\\. ビショップ, パターン認識と機械学習, 丸善出版 2012."
msgstr ""
"C\\. M\\. Bishop, `Pattern Recognition and Machine Learning`, Springer, "
"2006."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:76
msgid "ブロック行列の行列式"
msgstr "Determinant of a Block Matrix"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:78
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}, \\boldsymbol{D}` を正方行列とする。このとき、 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` が正則であれば"
msgstr ""
"Let :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}, \\boldsymbol{D}` be square matrices. If "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` is invertible, the determinant is given by the "
"following expression."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:81
msgid ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{D-CA^{-1}B}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{D-CA^{-1}B}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:94
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":math:`\\boldsymbol{D}` が正則であれば"
msgstr ""
"If :math:`\\boldsymbol{D}` is invertible, the determinant is given by the"
" expression below."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:96
msgid ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{D}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A-BD^{-1}C}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A} & \\boldsymbol{B} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{C} & \\boldsymbol{D} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{D}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A-BD^{-1}C}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:109
msgid "となる。"
msgstr "This gives the second formula for the determinant."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:111
msgid "ガウス分布の周辺分布の計算で現れる以下のケースを示しておく。"
msgstr ""
"The following case arises when calculating the marginal distribution of a"
" Gaussian distribution."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:113
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1} & -\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\\\\n"
"-\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} & \\beta\\boldsymbol{I} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"&=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{I} - \\beta^2\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} \\boldsymbol{S}_{1} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{I}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0 + "
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"- \\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\beta^{-1} \\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\beta^N\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1} & -\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\\\\n"
"-\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} & \\beta\\boldsymbol{I} \\\\\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"&=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{I} - \\beta^2\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} \\boldsymbol{S}_{1} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{I}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0 + "
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"- \\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\beta^{-1} \\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\beta^N\n"
"\\begin{vmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0\n"
"\\end{vmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:139
msgid "ここで"
msgstr "Here the following equation"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0 + "
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_{1}\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{S}^{-1}_0 + "
"\\beta\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:146
msgid "である。"
msgstr "defines the matrix used in the calculation above."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:153
msgid "一般化逆行列"
msgstr "Generalized Inverse"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`m \\times n` 行列 :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` に対して、次の4つの条件をすべて満たす "
":math:`n \\times m` 行列 :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}` "
"はただ1つ存在する。これをムーア・ペンローズの一般化逆行列（擬似逆行列）と呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"For an :math:`m \\times n` matrix :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}`, there is "
"exactly one :math:`n \\times m` matrix :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}` that "
"satisfies all four of the following conditions. It is called the "
"Moore–Penrose generalized inverse, or pseudoinverse."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:158
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"&\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\boldsymbol{A} , "
"\\qquad\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} , \\\\\n"
"&\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} \\right)^\\top = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} , \\qquad\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^\\top = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"&\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\boldsymbol{A} , "
"\\qquad\n"
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} , \\\\\n"
"&\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} \\right)^\\top = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} , \\qquad\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^\\top = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:165
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` が正方で正則なら :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{-1}` である。 :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` "
"の列が線形独立（:math:`\\mathrm{rank}\\,\\boldsymbol{A} = n`）なら "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A}` は正則で、"
msgstr ""
"If :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` is square and invertible, then "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = \\boldsymbol{A}^{-1}`. If the columns of "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}` are linearly independent "
"(:math:`\\mathrm{rank}\\,\\boldsymbol{A} = n`), then "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A}` is invertible and"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:169
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^{-1} "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^{-1} "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:175
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"となる。:math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\boldsymbol{I}` であることと、 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = \\boldsymbol{A}\\left( "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^{-1}\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top` "
"が対称であることから、 式 :eq:`mat_penrose` の4つの条件を確かめられる（たとえば "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{I} = \\boldsymbol{A}`）。"
msgstr ""
"Since :math:`\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\boldsymbol{I}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+} = \\boldsymbol{A}\\left( "
"\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top\\boldsymbol{A} \\right)^{-1}\\boldsymbol{A}^\\top` "
"is symmetric, the four conditions in Equation :eq:`mat_penrose` can be "
"checked directly (for example, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{+}\\boldsymbol{A} = "
"\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{I} = \\boldsymbol{A}`)."

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:179
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"一般化逆行列は最小二乗法の解を与える。\\ :ref:`最尤推定と最小二乗法<likelihood>`\\ の "
":math:`L(\\boldsymbol{w}) = \\frac{1}{2} "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})` を "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` で微分してゼロとおくと"
msgstr ""
"The generalized inverse gives the solution of least squares. Setting the "
"derivative of :math:`L(\\boldsymbol{w}) = \\frac{1}{2} "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})` in \\ :ref:`Maximum"
" Likelihood Estimation and Least Squares <likelihood>`\\  with respect to"
" :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` to zero gives"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} = "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} = "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:186
#, python-brace-format
msgid "が得られる（正規方程式）。\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` の列が線形独立なら、式 :eq:`mat_pinv` より"
msgstr ""
"which are called the normal equations. If the columns of \\ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` are linearly independent, Equation "
":eq:`mat_pinv` gives"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} \\right)^{-1} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{+} \\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"=\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi} \\right)^{-1} "
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top \\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{+} \\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/matrix_formula.rst:195
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"となる。\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` が正方で正則なら "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{+} = \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1}` で、 \\ "
":ref:`ガウス過程回帰<gaussian_process>`\\ の式 :eq:`gp2` に一致する。"
msgstr ""
"If \\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` is square and invertible, then "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{+} = \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1}`, and this "
"solution agrees with Equation :eq:`gp2` in \\ :ref:`Gaussian Process "
"Regression <gaussian_process>`\\ ."

